## STEP 4: Generate Video 1 — Explosion
Tool: Kling 2.6  — First Frame + Last Frame
Inputs:
| Input | Image | Description |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| First Frame | Step 1 image | Broken house + OPEN PALM |
| Last Frame | Step 2 image | Exploded house + CLENCHED FIST |
Duration: 5 seconds
Aspect Ratio: 9:16
Prompt:
Smooth, cinematic magical explosion animation. A mystical hand in the foreground starts with an open palm facing the broken house, then dramatically clenches into a fist. As the fist closes, magical energy pulses outward and the house responds by smoothly exploding apart — all components (roof, walls, windows, framing, foundation) separate and float outward in sync with the magic gesture. The motion is fluid and controlled with gentle easing. Magical particles and energy trails connect the fist to the floating house pieces. No jitter, no snapping, no shaking. Camera remains locked. Background unchanged. Photorealistic with fantasy magic elements.
Output: 5-second 9:16 video — House explodes

## STEP 5: Generate Video 2 — Renovation/Reassembly
Tool: Kling 2.6  — First Frame + Last Frame
Inputs:
| Input | Image | Description |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| First Frame | Step 2 image | Exploded house + CLENCHED FIST |
| Last Frame | Step 3 image | Renovated house + OPEN PALM |
Duration: 5 seconds
Aspect Ratio: 9:16
Prompt:
Smooth, cinematic magical renovation animation. The exploded house pieces float in the air while a clenched fist holds them suspended. The fist slowly opens into an open palm, and as it does, magical golden energy flows outward. The floating pieces transform — broken wood becomes fresh lumber, shattered glass becomes crystal clear windows, rotted shingles become pristine roofing. The transformed pieces smoothly glide back together, assembling into a beautiful fully renovated house. The environment transforms from gloomy to sunny and vibrant. Golden sparkles and light rays emanate from the palm. Motion is fluid and magical. Camera remains locked. Photorealistic with warm fantasy magic elements.
Output: 5-second 9:16 video — Exploded pieces transform & reassemble into renovated house

